            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Devkitty 1.0.0 (build 425)</h2>
<ul>
<li>A card whose agent is busy no longer stays in Need Human when it has an open pull request. It goes to In Progress and goes back when the agent stops.</li>
<li>New list actions: "Move all cards to Trash" and "Move all cards to Trash and close tabs". One Undo restores the cards.</li>
<li>Closed cards keep the icon they had while their workspace was open. Cards closed before this build still show the terminal icon.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
